Get the text out of a PDF offline
	:comment Challenge: OCR with no network or key
	:comment Approach: on-device Vision, one file
	Start the tool on a PDF
		:if Compiled for faster startup?
			$ swiftc -O ocr_pdf.swift -o ocr_pdf@$ ./ocr_pdf doc.pdf ja,en
		:else
			$ swift ocr_pdf.swift doc.pdf ja,en
	Choose recognition languages
		:if Languages given?
			Use the given codes
		:else
			Use ja,en
	:while Pages left?
		Render the page at 2x scale@on a white background
		Recognize the text with Vision@(.accurate, language correction)
		Print the top candidate per line@under "=== Page N ==="
	:terminal Plain text on stdout
